The Menù App is an important tool for customers and reps, but not only.
Products, recipes and services at your fingertips make it easier to consult the catalogue and interact with the Menù world; for members of the Menù Club, lots of special additional content. 
You can save your favourite products, recipes and services, create your wishlist and share content via various channels.

Some of the operations you can carry out with the Menù App:
- Consult the catalogue of products, recipes and services;
- Save your favourite content to keep all the information at your fingertips;
- Create a wishlist that you can easily share with your rep or friends;
- Keep up to date with the latest news at all times;
- Use the search tool to discover the products and recipes that suit you best.

